abstract: "A local-first desktop interface for locally managed language models and repository-grounded exploration of scientific dynamical-model repositories. Ask the Model v0.5.0 adds explicit Save to History conversation archiving with exact-context restore and deterministic managed JSON mirrors, while promoting hardened SQLite control/conversation state, startup qualification and exact-SHA repository provenance."
keywords:
  - local AI
  - local-first
  - large language models
  - Ollama
